    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for an exciting adventure in \u201cThe gold is mine\u201d! You control a fearless miner who, after discovering a valuable gold nugget, must cross a challenging river to reach his boat and escape with his treasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump and dodge logs, rocks and other obstacles as you navigate through a vibrant setting full of challenges. With each jump, you'll feel the adrenaline rise, and with each level, new surprises and difficulties will arise to test your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you overcome all the obstacles and make sure you escape with the gold? Get ready for a journey full of action and fun!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for an exciting adventure in \u201cThe gold is mine\u201d! You control a fearless miner who, after discovering a valuable gold nugget, must cross a challenging river to reach his boat and escape with his treasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump and dodge logs, rocks and other obstacles as you navigate through a vibrant setting full of challenges. With each jump, you'll feel the adrenaline rise, and with each level, new surprises and difficulties will arise to test your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you overcome all the obstacles and make sure you escape with the gold? Get ready for a journey full of action and fun!</p>",
